#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:5
msgid "Select all objects"
msgstr "选择全部对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows selecting all object from `workspace`_, all objects from"
" the activated `folio`_, at the same time. All objects can be selected from "
"`menu bar`_, `workspace`_ or using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许同时选择 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中的所有对象，以及已激活 `图幅 <folio_>`_ "
"中的所有对象。所有对象都可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 、`工作区 <workspace_>`_ 或相应的键盘快捷键来选择。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:12
msgid "Select all objects from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏选择所有对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:14
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Select All** to select all objects from the activated "
"`folio`_."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 选择全部** ，即可选择已激活 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 中的所有对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:22
msgid "Select all objects from workspace"
msgstr "从工作区选择所有对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:24
msgid ""
"As many other CAD tools, QElectroTech allows selecting all elements from the"
" `workspace`_, graphical area, using the mouse."
msgstr "与许多其他 CAD 工具一样，QElectroTech 允许使用鼠标从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的图形区域中选择所有元件。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:27
msgid ""
"Left click on the initial point from the rectangular area to be selected and"
" displace the mouse without releasing up to the end point."
msgstr "在待选矩形区域的起点处单击左键，按住鼠标拖动至终点，途中不要松开。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:32
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech selecting on workspace"
msgstr "图：在 QElectroTech 工作区中选择"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:35
msgid "Select all objects using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键选择所有对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:37
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:39
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + a`` to select all objects from the activated `folio`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + a`` 可选择已激活 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 中的所有对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_all.rst:43
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
